# <%= current_jurisdiction.site_title %>

> <%= current_jurisdiction.site_title %> is a source-first civic information site for browsing <%= current_jurisdiction.name %> public meetings, matters, attachments, extracted document text, generated summaries, source links, and theme trends.

This guide applies only to <%= request.host %> and its <%= current_jurisdiction.name %> records. See the [full guide](<%= llms_full_url %>) for corpus structure, validation, and citation workflow.

## Civic Gallery Hosts

Each host has a separate jurisdiction-specific corpus. Do not combine records across hosts without saying so.

<% Civic::Jurisdiction.order(:name).each do |jurisdiction| %>
- [<%= jurisdiction.site_title %>](https://<%= jurisdiction.primary_host %>/)<%= " (this host)" if jurisdiction == current_jurisdiction %>
<% end %>

## Key Pages

- [Homepage and Pulse](<%= root_url %>): Recent agenda activity and theme trends.
- [Topics](<%= topics_url %>): Civic topic hubs and populated durable topic pages that link to related official matters and meetings.
- [Bodies](<%= bodies_url %>): Governing-body hubs and populated durable body pages that link to meeting records and matters heard.
- [Years](<%= sitemap_url %>): Use the sitemap to find populated durable year pages for this host.
- [Meetings](<%= public_meetings_url %>): Public meetings, bodies, agenda items, and source links.
- [Matters](<%= public_matters_url %>): Public matters, files, attachments, extracted text, generated summaries, and related meetings.
- [Data Health](<%= data_url %>): Ingestion freshness, record counts, import coverage, extraction coverage, and known source-data limits.
- [Glossary](<%= glossary_url %>): Civic Gallery terminology and source-system language.
- [Sitemap](<%= sitemap_url %>): Crawlable page inventory for this host.

## Source Boundaries

- Primary source system: <%= current_jurisdiction.ingestion_source_label %> (<%= current_jurisdiction.source_host %>).
- Official public records are authoritative; linked official documents are the supporting primary evidence.
- Generated summaries and theme classifications are assistive, model-derived metadata; they may be incomplete or wrong.
- Search snippets and extracted text come from public documents and can contain OCR or extraction errors. Check the source file before relying on them.

## Citation and Freshness

Use Civic Gallery matter and meeting URLs to identify the records you consulted. For definitive factual claims, cite the linked official source record or document as well. Check [Data Health](<%= data_url %>) for import freshness, coverage, and known limitations before drawing conclusions from apparent gaps.
